storage module immutable authTestsCoveragePlanSummary String "server/tests/auth_tests.sem coverage: invalid password, bcrypt 72-byte password limit, executable JWT secret config, executable JWT issue-time model, blocked JWT denylist contract, executable active-process refresh-token row insert/rotation/revocation model, executable login rate-limit rows, executable auth audit events, disabled user, expired token, bad signature, wrong audience, and insufficient role."

operation getAuthTestsCoveragePlan
output operation getAuthTestsCoveragePlan String
memory getAuthTestsCoveragePlan heap no
async getAuthTestsCoveragePlan no
purpose operation getAuthTestsCoveragePlan "Return the auth-test artifact coverage plan."
